Updated. The repository is here<https://sites.google.com/site/slovlacukt/file-cabinet?pli=1>
.

Changelog:

2011.05.17. All dictionaries have been converted to UTF-8 encoding (robin, 
thanks for pointing out !)
2011.05.17. jbo-eng_rupnu and eng-jbo_rupnu were in fact buggy so they are 
fixed now  (robin, thanks for pointing out !)
2011.05.17. jbo-jbo_la-uikipedias (i.e. export of jbo.wikipedia.org) is 
temporarily disabled (the dsl file is empty) until new better conversion is 
applied
2011.04.28. "Etymology (Jbo-Eng)" renamed to "Etymology (Jbo-Jbo)"
2011.04.28. "jbo-jbo_pixra_liste_loi_gismu" renamed to 
"jbo-jbo_pixra_liste_loi_gismu". One bug fixed + one valsi added.
2011.04.28. "jbo_jbo_gismu-picture-association" dict added to "pixra 
package". It's based on 
quizlet.com/5162095/basic-lojban-gismu-picture-association-flash-cards/
2011.04.28. fixing bugs in "eng-jbo_basic-english-wordlist"
2011.04.28. "jbovlaste glosswords (Eng-Jbo)" discontinued. It'll be removed 
from all further packages.
Enable "jbovlaste (Jbo-Eng)" instead as a better alternative.
2011.04.25. "jbovlaste (Eng-Jbo)" and "jbovlaste (Jbo-Eng)" dictionaries 
exported from the latest jbovlaste dump

